 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The indirect object (to whom)",
     "texto": [
      "The indirect pronoun replaces the person or recipient: **Telefono a Marco → Gli telefono**; **Scrivo a Sara → Le scrivo**; **Mando un messaggio agli amici → Gli mando un messaggio** (or *mando loro*)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Key distinction: direct versus indirect",
     "texto": [
      "Don't mix them up: **Lo vedo** (I see him: direct object), but **Gli parlo** (I speak to him: indirect object, speaking *to* him). **La chiamo** (I call her: direct), but **Le rispondo** (I answer her: indirect, answering *to* her)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Direct versus indirect",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "With direct pronoun (what / whom?)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "With indirect pronoun (to whom?)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
